*> MOVE and COMPUTE into items whose PICTURE is smaller than the value.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TRUNCATION.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 SMALL    PIC 9(3)V99.
01 U3 PIC 9(3).
01 S3   PIC S9(3).
01 ONE-DEC  PIC 9V9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 12345.678 TO SMALL
    DISPLAY "move 12345.678 to 9(3)V99=" SMALL
    COMPUTE SMALL = 12345.678
    DISPLAY "compute 12345.678 to 9(3)V99=" SMALL
    MOVE -5 TO U3
    DISPLAY "move -5 to 9(3)=" U3
    COMPUTE U3 = 2 - 7
    DISPLAY "compute 2 - 7 to 9(3)=" U3
    COMPUTE S3 = 2 - 7
    DISPLAY "compute 2 - 7 to S9(3)=" S3
    MOVE 1.999 TO ONE-DEC
    DISPLAY "move 1.999 to 9V9=" ONE-DEC
    STOP RUN.
